an:202609/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]provenance_refresh_conflicts.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim] Prompt: [#87AFFF][/dim]prompts/202609/provenance_refresh_conflicts.md[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Bead: [#87AFFF][/dim]sase-112[/#87AFFF]\n[dim]   Page: [#87AFFF][/dim]https://github.com/sase-org/sase--beads/blob/main/pages/sase-112/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]README.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Additive provenance section merging[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]additive-provenance-merge[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]additive-provenance-merge: make refresh_association_sections and both [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]refresh callers union locally derived AGENTS/COMMITS entries with the [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan file's existing entries (derived side wins per-key metadata, no [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]entry is ever dropped for being outside the local view), with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]deterministic ordering pinned by idempotence and merge-stability tests.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Plan-header semantic conflict resolver[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]plan-header-conflict-resolver[dim] · [dim][/dim]after additive-provenance-merge[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]plan-header-conflict-resolver: add a resolver to the SDD semantic [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]conflict chain that claims plans-store month-dir markdown conflicts and,[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]when stages differ only in generated AGENTS/COMMITS sections, resolves [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]by unioning both sides with the phase-1 merge helper, failing closed on [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]any authored difference.[/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF][/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Stop stale SASE_PLAN attribution[/bold #D7A